    "quote": "Lemma 8.6. Let N = vt \u00b7 \u2202y on T2 , with vt as in (6.2), and let F be a smooth function of zero Haar\nmean. Then N \u03c6 = F has a unique smooth zero-mean solution \u03c6 = N \u22121 F. This solution is given by\nthe following Fourier series and satisfies the displayed norm bound for every integer m \u2265 0:\n                                        F\u02c6\ufe01(k ) 2\u03c0ik\u00b7y\n                 N \u22121 F =      \u2211       2\u03c0ivt \u00b7 k\n                                                 e     ,     \u2225 N \u22121 F \u2225Cym \u2264 Cm \u2225 F \u2225Cym+4 .        (8.19)\n                            k \u2208Z2 \\{0}\n"
  },
